#: site/lectures/05-lists-advanced.md:809
msgid "Reference: [generator expressions](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#generator-expressions), [`zip`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#zip), [`enumerate`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#enumerate)"
msgstr "Reference: [generator expressions](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#generator-expressions), [`zip`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#zip), [`enumerate`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#enumerate)"

#. paragraph
